{
  "name": "dsh-effort-mosaic",
  "version": "1.1.1",
  "description": "把 DSH 模型菜单里的推理等级档位换成一条滑轨：马赛克粒子墙（右侧静止、越往左越散）或 霓虹（蓝轨道 + 最高档蓝紫擦除渐变）。两套风格可切换 / A reasoning-effort track for DeepSeek Harness, with a pixel-mosaic style and a 霓虹变体",
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/xiaobaga281/dsh-effort-mosaic.git"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "reasoning-effort",
    "slider",
    "ui"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/smoke.mjs",
    "promo": "node tools/make-promo.mjs"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  }
}
